<link rel="amphtml" href="https://www.bananacrystal.com/.well-known/x402?amp"><link rel="icon" href="https://media.bananacrystal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/17010144/cropped-bananacrystal-logo-icon-512x512-1-1-32x32.png" sizes="32x32" />
